---
const options = [
  {
    href: '/preview/tabletop',
    name: 'Tabletop',
    line: 'The games as physical objects',
    detail:
      'Green felt table, cardboard box lids, brass funding pips. Leans on the fact that these are board games you eventually hold, not apps you download.',
    palette: ['#1d3b32', '#ece0c8', '#b98c2f', '#983a26'],
    type: 'Anton / Karla / Space Mono',
  },
  {
    href: '/preview/pipeline',
    name: 'Pipeline',
    line: 'Campaigns grouped by build stage',
    detail:
      'Light, precise, technical. Games are sorted onto a rail by funding stage: concept, prototype, production. Speaks the developer audience\u2019s own vocabulary.',
    palette: ['#f6f5f1', '#17171c', '#2f2fa8', '#8a5a06'],
    type: 'IBM Plex Sans Condensed / Sans / Mono',
  },
  {
    href: '/preview/arcade',
    name: 'Arcade',
    line: 'A high-score leaderboard',
    detail:
      'Loud and competitive. One spotlit campaign, then every title ranked by backer rating in a scoreboard. Highest energy of the three.',
    palette: ['#180f2e', '#ff3d8b', '#3fe0ec', '#f4efff'],
    type: 'Archivo Black / Archivo / DM Mono',
  },
];
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Design directions - Tailspin Toys</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,400;12..96,500;12..96,600;12..96,700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="shell">
      <p class="kicker">Design exploration</p>
      <h1>Three directions for Tailspin Toys</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Each is a full working page rendering the real catalog. Funding figures are placeholders,
        since the database has no funding columns yet. Pick one and I will build it out properly,
        or mix parts of several.
      </p>

      <ul class="options">
        {options.map((option) => (
          <li>
            <a href={option.href}>
              <div class="swatches" aria-hidden="true">
                {option.palette.map((color) => (
                  <span style={`background: ${color}`}></span>
                ))}
              </div>
              <h2>{option.name}</h2>
              <p class="line">{option.line}</p>
              <p class="detail">{option.detail}</p>
              <p class="type">{option.type}</p>
              <span class="go">View direction &rarr;</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>

      <p class="back"><a href="/">Back to the current site</a></p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: #0e1117;
    color: #e8ecf4;
    font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .shell {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 72px 24px 90px;
  }

  a {
    color: inherit;
  }

  :focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #6ea8ff;
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .kicker {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #7f8da5;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 50px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.06;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .lede {
    margin: 0 0 52px;
    max-width: 60ch;
    font-size: 17px;
    color: #aab6c9;
  }

  .options {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 48px;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(290px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .options a {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100%;
    padding: 26px 24px 24px;
    background: #151b26;
    border: 1px solid #26303f;
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      border-color 0.16s ease,
      transform 0.16s ease;
  }

  .options a:hover {
    border-color: #6ea8ff;
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .swatches {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .swatches span {
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
  }

  .options h2 {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .line {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #6ea8ff;
  }

  .detail {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #aab6c9;
  }

  .type {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #7f8da5;
  }

  .go {
    margin-top: auto;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #e8ecf4;
  }

  .back {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .back a {
    color: #aab6c9;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    * {
      transition: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
